<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Dear {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},<br />
&nbsp;<br />
We have been trying to contact you regarding your wheelchair request. We require some additional information to finalise this request for your upcoming booking.<br />
<br />
Supporting customers with mobility requirements is incredibly important to us, and having the correct details ensures we can provide the right assistance and make your journey as smooth and comfortable as possible.<br />
<br />
<strong>Please provide the following information:</strong><br />
<br />
Are you travelling with your own Mobility Aid? &nbsp;<strong>Yes / No</strong><br />
Do you require assistance transferring from the Mobility Aid and the Aircraft Seat? &nbsp;<strong>Yes / No</strong><br />
Will you be travelling with a carer? <strong>Yes / No</strong><br />
<br />
Dimensions (when folded/collapsed):
<ul>
	<li><strong>Height: __ cm</strong></li>
	<li><strong>Width: __ cm&nbsp;</strong></li>
	<li><strong>Depth: __ cm</strong></li>
	<li><strong>Weight: __kg</strong></li>
</ul>
If you have any questions, please contact us on 13 13 13 at your earliest convenience.<br />
<br />
Thank you for your assistance, and we look forward to welcoming you onboard soon.<br />
&nbsp;</body>
